  "description": "Murdered on her wedding day, Alena returns as a ghost to kill the mastermind of her assassination: her very own groom. What happens when her target is not only the most powerful man in the kingdom but could also see and touch a ghost? His touch unraveled sensations she was supposed to never feel again. But Alena is determined to fulfill her dying wish and not even the mysterious duke’s allure could stop her from delivering justice with her own two hands.\nSource: Webtoon",
